{"version":1,"content":"<p>第63屆金馬獎頒獎典禮圓滿落幕，雖然多位呼聲極高的男星最終與獎座擦身而過，但典禮後的慶功宴依然氣氛熱絡。</p><p>憑藉《狂忘警探》雙雙入圍最佳男主角與男配角的阮經天、黃冠智，昨日（23日）凌晨現身劇組慶功宴，心情絲毫未受失獎影響。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:03:58.256950+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:31:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:57:13.220258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:57:13.220258+00:00","content_hash":"6b4342ba65c914a39336a8bb1ec6084d49452ddeb1f19609bf97e07a4a2683a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}